#: src/unsafe-deep-dive/introduction/responsibility-shift.md:6
msgid "Unsafe keyword shifts responsibility"
msgstr ""

#: src/unsafe-deep-dive/introduction/responsibility-shift.md:8
msgid "Is Memory Safe?"
msgstr ""

#: src/unsafe-deep-dive/introduction/responsibility-shift.md:8
msgid "Responsibility for Memory Safety"
msgstr ""

#: src/unsafe-deep-dive/introduction/responsibility-shift.md:10
msgid "Safe Rust"
msgstr ""

#: src/unsafe-deep-dive/introduction/responsibility-shift.md:10
#: src/unsafe-deep-dive/introduction/responsibility-shift.md:11
msgid "Yes"
msgstr ""

#: src/unsafe-deep-dive/introduction/responsibility-shift.md:10
msgid "Compiler"
msgstr ""

#: src/unsafe-deep-dive/introduction/responsibility-shift.md:11
msgid "Unsafe Rust"
msgstr ""

#: src/unsafe-deep-dive/introduction/responsibility-shift.md:11
msgid "Programmer"
msgstr ""

#: src/unsafe-deep-dive/introduction/responsibility-shift.md:16
msgid "Who has responsibility for memory safety?"
msgstr ""

#: src/unsafe-deep-dive/introduction/responsibility-shift.md:18
msgid "Safe Rust → compiler"
msgstr ""

#: src/unsafe-deep-dive/introduction/responsibility-shift.md:19
msgid "Unsafe Rust → programmer"
msgstr ""

#: src/unsafe-deep-dive/introduction/responsibility-shift.md:21
msgid ""
"“While writing safe Rust, you cannot create memory safety problems. The "
"compiler will ensure that a program with mistakes will not build.”"
msgstr ""

#: src/unsafe-deep-dive/introduction/responsibility-shift.md:24
msgid ""
"“The `unsafe` keyword shifts responsibility for maintaining memory safety "
"from the compiler to programmers. It signals that there are preconditions "
"that must be satisfied."
msgstr ""

#: src/unsafe-deep-dive/introduction/responsibility-shift.md:28
msgid ""
"“To uphold that responsibility, programmers must ensure that they've "
"understood what the preconditions are and that their code will always "
"satisfy them."
msgstr ""

#: src/unsafe-deep-dive/introduction/responsibility-shift.md:31
msgid ""
"“Throughout this course, we'll use the term _safety preconditions_ to "
"describe this situation.”"
msgstr ""
